# 04 · Structure v2 (homepage), 20 Oct 2026

Inputs: 01-icp.md, 02-brand-voice.md, 03b-search-data.md, GATE-1-v2.md. Supersedes 04-structure.md.

## Who arrives, and in what state
| Arrival | Share of homepage visitors | State | What they need first |
|---|---|---|---|
| Direct (bookmarks, app users, reels and Reddit with the referrer stripped) | 59% | Mixed. Includes the ICP arriving from reels. | The promise and one button |
| Google and Bing: "700 verses", "today's verse", "verses in Sanskrit" | 18% | Product-aware about the Gita; wants to read | A visible way to read, and today's verse |
| Internal (from verse, blog and Hindi pages) | 14% | Already reading | The plan, since they already trust the text |
| ChatGPT | 10% | Asked an AI where to read the Gita, or which version to read | A plain, factual answer they can confirm |

Behaviour constraint: only 13% scroll past a quarter of the page. The hero carries the offer and the reader path. Section 2 is the strongest engagement we have (audio, 19% of search landers play it).

